==History==
2016
*The Electro Wizard was once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Electro Wizard Challenge]], which started on 23/12/2016. In this [[Tournament|challenge]], the player would build a [[Battle Decks|deck]] which included the Electro Wizard. If the player achieved 12 wins, they obtained the Electro Wizard early, in addition to the normal prizes.
*The Electro Wizard [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 30/12/2016.
2017
*On 23/1/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/1/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the Electro Wizard's spawn damage by 6% and increased his hitpoints by 9%.
*On 13/3/2017, the [[Version History#March 2017 Update (13/3/2017)|March 2017 Update]], removed the Electro Wizard's ability to permanently stun enemy [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]]. It also added the audience sound effects when the Electro Wizard is deployed.
*On 19/4/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/4/2017)|Balance Update]], increased the Electro Wizard's attack time interval to 1.8 seconds (from 1.7 seconds) and increased his first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.3 seconds).
*On 11/8/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (11/8/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the Electro Wizard's hitpoints by 2%.
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic Quests Update (9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], decreased his damage by 4% and increased his first attack time interval to 0.6 seconds (from 0.4 seconds).
2018
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Electro Wizard from Royal Arena to Electro Valley.
*On 3/9/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/9/2018)|Balance Update]], made it so that the Electro Wizard can no longer reset the attack of the [[Zappies]].
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards start at Level 9 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 5).
2020
*On 2/1/2020, a maintenance break, fixed an issue where the Electro Wizard's [[Star Points|Star Level]] used the sound effects of the [[Electro Dragon]].
*On 6/10/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2020)|Balance Update]], added a card render to the Electro Wizard's card info screen.
*On 3/11/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/11/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Electro Wizard's damage by 3.5%.
*On 9/12/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/12/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Electro Wizard's damage by 2.5%.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13). It also removed the [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] Spawn Damage statistic from the Electro Wizard's card info screen.
*On 1/11/2021, an [[Version History#Optional%20Update%20(1/11/2021)|Optional Update]], made it so that the [[Mega Knight]] cannot be stunned infinitely by the Electro Wizard.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14). It also added the Debilitator [[Card Mastery]] task for the Electro Wizard.
2024
*On 6/8/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/8/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Electro Wizard's spawn area radius to 3 tiles (from 2.5 tiles).
2025
*On 4/3/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Electro Wizard's damage by 5%.
*On 31/3/2024, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Electro Wizard's hitpoints by 0.14%, and his damage by 0.86%.
*On 1/4/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (1/4/2025)|maintenance break]] fixed a bug where Electro Wizard could nullify [[Lumberjack/Evolution|Lumberjack]]'s and [[Wall Breakers/Evolution|Wall Breakers]]' Evolutions' death effects.

